  "fullSubtitles": [
    {
      "start": "00:33:56,754",
      "end": "00:34:00,624",
      "text": "Five, six, seven, and tippy-toes, tippy-toes."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:34:00,658",
      "end": "00:34:02,360",
      "text": "I don't see your tippy-toes."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:34:02,394",
      "end": "00:34:04,162",
      "text": "Oh, come on, he's having a laugh."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:34:04,196",
      "end": "00:34:06,098",
      "text": "- Tippy-toes. Come on, let's go. - Seven, and..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:34:06,131",
      "end": "00:34:09,600",
      "text": "That is rubbish, terribly poor, really bad."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:34:11,869",
      "end": "00:34:14,406",
      "text": "That bloke absolutely hates me."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:34:14,439",
      "end": "00:34:16,141",
      "text": "Hang in there, Johnny."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:34:16,174",
      "end": "00:34:17,775",
      "text": "The first week's always tough."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:34:17,808",
      "end": "00:34:19,743",
      "text": "Yeah. You're right. You're right."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:34:19,777",
      "end": "00:34:21,679",
      "text": "Meena, come and meet your partner."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:34:21,712",
      "end": "00:34:22,746",
      "text": "Oh, my gosh, he's here?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:34:22,780",
      "end": "00:34:24,316",
      "text": "Yep. He's called Darius."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:34:24,349",
      "end": "00:34:25,916",
      "text": "Won a ton of awards."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:34:25,950",
      "end": "00:34:28,353",
      "text": "And I think you guys are gonna have great chemistry."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:34:28,386",
      "end": "00:34:30,255",
      "text": "♪ If I was your boyfriend ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:34:30,288",
      "end": "00:34:32,923",
      "text": "♪ I'd never let you go ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:34:32,957",
      "end": "00:34:35,260",
      "text": "♪ Keep you on my arm, girl ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:34:35,293",
      "end": "00:34:37,761",
      "text": "♪ You'd never be alone ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:34:37,795",
      "end": "00:34:40,365",
      "text": "♪ I can be a gentleman ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:34:40,398",
      "end": "00:34:42,234",
      "text": "♪ Anything you want ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:34:42,267",
      "end": "00:34:43,801",
      "text": "- Wow. - ♪ If I... ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:34:43,834",
      "end": "00:34:45,270",
      "text": "That's really great, Darius."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:34:45,303",
      "end": "00:34:47,771",
      "text": "Uh, yeah, it's a scene from the last show I was in."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:34:47,805",
      "end": "00:34:50,142",
      "text": "I'm sure you heard of it... Hope Against Hope."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:34:50,175",
      "end": "00:34:53,010",
      "text": "Gosh, I won every award in town."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:34:53,043",
      "end": "00:34:55,045",
      "text": "Uh, the Golden Piccolo for Best Crying."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:34:55,080",
      "end": "00:34:56,814",
      "text": "Uh, the Archer Newman Award"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:34:56,847",
      "end": "00:34:58,383",
      "text": "for Outstanding Hair."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:34:58,416",
      "end": "00:34:59,950",
      "text": "Oh, yeah. Yeah, yeah, yeah."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:34:59,984",
      "end": "00:35:02,220",
      "text": "Anyway, my costar, she was just like you, Gina."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:35:02,254",
      "end": "00:35:04,222",
      "text": "- She was, uh... - Uh, it's Meena."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:35:04,256",
      "end": "00:35:05,390",
      "text": "Excuse me?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:35:05,423",
      "end": "00:35:08,692",
      "text": "M-My name, it's Meena, not Gina."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:35:08,726",
      "end": "00:35:10,027",
      "text": "Yeah, okay."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:35:10,061",
      "end": "00:35:12,397",
      "text": "In the future, if you could not interrupt me,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:35:12,430",
      "end": "00:35:14,166",
      "text": "that would be way better."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:35:14,199",
      "end": "00:35:16,468",
      "text": "Okay, okay. Let's rehearse."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:35:18,136",
      "end": "00:35:21,072",
      "text": "♪ Don't wanna close my eyes ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:35:21,106",
      "end": "00:35:23,475",
      "text": "♪ Don't wanna fall asleep ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:35:23,508",
      "end": "00:35:25,709",
      "text": "- ♪ 'Cause I'd miss you, babe ♪ - Uh, uh, uh..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:35:25,743",
      "end": "00:35:27,078",
      "text": "- ♪ And I ♪ - Oh."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:35:27,112",
      "end": "00:35:29,214",
      "text": "♪ Don't wanna miss a thing... ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:35:29,247",
      "end": "00:35:30,448",
      "text": "No, no, no, no, no, uh..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:35:30,482",
      "end": "00:35:33,050",
      "text": "This song is not helping her at all."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:35:33,084",
      "end": "00:35:36,354",
      "text": "♪ When I saw you in that dress ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:35:36,388",
      "end": "00:35:39,191",
      "text": "♪ Looking so beautiful ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:35:39,224",
      "end": "00:35:42,793",
      "text": "♪ I don't deserve this ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:35:42,826",
      "end": "00:35:45,130",
      "text": "♪ Darling, you look ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:35:45,163",
      "end": "00:35:48,200",
      "text": "♪ Perfect tonight. ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:35:48,233",
      "end": "00:35:49,733",
      "text": "Oh, boy."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:35:49,767",
      "end": "00:35:51,869",
      "text": "So, where's Calloway?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:35:51,902",
      "end": "00:35:53,837",
      "text": "Uh, he'll be here very soon."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:35:53,871",
      "end": "00:35:56,074",
      "text": "- Mm, is that so? - It is indeed so."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:35:56,107",
      "end": "00:35:58,809",
      "text": "In fact, my trusty assistant Miss Crawly"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:35:58,842",
      "end": "00:36:01,213",
      "text": "is on her way to meet him right now."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:36:04,282",
      "end": "00:36:06,184",
      "text": "- ♪ Wake up ♪ - ♪ Wake up ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:36:06,218",
      "end": "00:36:08,286",
      "text": "- ♪ Grab a brush and put a little makeup ♪ - ♪ Makeup ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:36:08,320",
      "end": "00:36:10,355",
      "text": "- ♪ Hide your scars to fade away the shake-up ♪ - ♪ Doo-doo ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:36:10,388",
      "end": "00:36:12,424",
      "text": "- ♪ Why'd you leave the keys upon the table? ♪ - ♪ The table ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:36:12,457",
      "end": "00:36:14,226",
      "text": "- ♪ Here you go, create another fable ♪ - ♪ You wanted to ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:36:14,259",
      "end": "00:36:16,026",
      "text": "♪ Grab a brush and put a little makeup... ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:36:16,061",
      "end": "00:36:17,095",
      "text": "Your destination is on the right."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:36:17,128",
      "end": "00:36:18,796",
      "text": "On the right. Okay."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:36:59,471",
      "end": "00:37:01,872",
      "text": "Oh."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:37:14,352",
      "end": "00:37:15,786",
      "text": "Oh."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:37:25,130",
      "end": "00:37:26,997",
      "text": "Mr. Calloway?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:37:27,031",
      "end": "00:37:28,899",
      "text": "Hello?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:37:28,932",
      "end": "00:37:31,035",
      "text": "Is anybody home?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:37:40,278",
      "end": "00:37:41,346",
      "text": "Ooh."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:38:02,634",
      "end": "00:38:04,602",
      "text": "Okay, I got you."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:38:20,318",
      "end": "00:38:22,220",
      "text": "Clay Callowa..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:38:28,293",
      "end": "00:38:29,893",
      "text": "Oopsie-daisy."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:38:29,927",
      "end": "00:38:31,262",
      "text": "Hello."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:38:31,296",
      "end": "00:38:33,631",
      "text": "I can't take your call right now,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:38:33,665",
      "end": "00:38:37,102",
      "text": "but please leave me a message after the beep."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:38:38,670",
      "end": "00:38:40,305",
      "text": "Miss Crawly, it's me, Mr. Moon."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:38:40,338",
      "end": "00:38:42,107",
      "text": "I haven't heard from you in a while."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:38:42,140",
      "end": "00:38:43,508",
      "text": "I'm starting to worry here."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:38:43,541",
      "end": "00:38:44,975",
      "text": "Moon!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:38:45,008",
      "end": "00:38:46,644",
      "text": "Mr. Crystal."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:38:46,678",
      "end": "00:38:49,381",
      "text": "Your set designs are a disgrace."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:38:49,414",
      "end": "00:38:51,014",
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:38:52,317",
      "end": "00:38:54,686",
      "text": "I'm just messing with you."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:38:54,719",
      "end": "00:38:56,987",
      "text": "Where's your sense of humor, huh?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:38:58,256",
      "end": "00:39:00,392",
      "text": "Anyway, this is my daughter Porsha."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:39:00,425",
      "end": "00:39:01,659",
      "text": "Hey."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:39:01,693",
      "end": "00:39:03,294",
      "text": "Nice to meet you, Porsha."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:39:03,328",
      "end": "00:39:05,296",
      "text": "She wants to meet Calloway. Big fan, aren't you, baby?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:39:05,330",
      "end": "00:39:08,199",
      "text": "Oh, my gosh, I'm, like, so into vintage right now."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:39:08,233",
      "end": "00:39:09,467",
      "text": "So, where is he?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:39:09,501",
      "end": "00:39:11,269",
      "text": "Uh, well..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:39:11,302",
      "end": "00:39:13,971",
      "text": "I-I'm not expecting Clay on set just yet."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:39:14,004",
      "end": "00:39:15,407",
      "text": "- I mean... - Wait."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:39:15,440",
      "end": "00:39:17,007",
      "text": "Is this, like, a sky-fi show?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:39:17,040",
      "end": "00:39:19,544",
      "text": "Uh, sci-fi? Yes. Yes, it is."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:39:19,577",
      "end": "00:39:22,380",
      "text": "Oh, my gosh, I love sky-fi."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:39:22,414",
      "end": "00:39:23,681",
      "text": "Mr. Moon!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:39:23,715",
      "end": "00:39:25,949",
      "text": "- We're ready on the tower. - Oh."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:39:25,983",
      "end": "00:39:27,352",
      "text": "Thank you, Sasha. We, uh..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:39:27,385",
      "end": "00:39:29,287",
      "text": "We're gonna rehearse, Mr. Crystal, so..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:39:29,320",
      "end": "00:39:31,556",
      "text": "Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah. You go and do your rehearsing thing."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:39:31,589",
      "end": "00:39:33,258",
      "text": "- Go, go, go, go. - Playback."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:39:35,693",
      "end": "00:39:37,362",
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:39:37,395",
      "end": "00:39:38,229",
      "text": "All set."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:39:38,263",
      "end": "00:39:40,064",
      "text": "Just remember to release the safety catch"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:39:40,098",
      "end": "00:39:41,566",
      "text": "before you jump, okay?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:39:41,599",
      "end": "00:39:43,101",
      "text": "Okay, yeah."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:39:43,134",
      "end": "00:39:45,002",
      "text": "Is Mommy gonna jump off that?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:39:45,035",
      "end": "00:39:46,571",
      "text": "She sure is."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:39:46,604",
      "end": "00:39:48,640",
      "text": "Wow!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:39:48,673",
      "end": "00:39:50,708",
      "text": "♪ If you want it ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:39:50,742",
      "end": "00:39:53,043",
      "text": "♪ Take it ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:39:53,077",
      "end": "00:39:56,046",
      "text": "♪ I should've said it before ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:39:56,080",
      "end": "00:39:58,048",
      "text": "♪ Tried to hide it ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:39:58,082",
      "end": "00:40:00,585",
      "text": "♪ Fake it ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:40:00,618",
      "end": "00:40:03,455",
      "text": "♪ I can't pretend anymore... ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:40:08,793",
      "end": "00:40:10,462",
      "text": "Uh..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:40:10,495",
      "end": "00:40:12,063",
      "text": "Oh, my gosh."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:40:12,096",
      "end": "00:40:13,731",
      "text": "Gunter."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:40:13,765",
      "end": "00:40:16,634",
      "text": "Mr. Moon, I think Rosita's having, like,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:40:16,668",
      "end": "00:40:19,204",
      "text": "a major freak-out up here."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:40:19,237",
      "end": "00:40:20,205",
      "text": "Oh, no."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:40:20,238",
      "end": "00:40:22,005",
      "text": "Hey, Moon, you really think the mommy pig's"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:40:22,039",
      "end": "00:40:23,341",
      "text": "gonna pull this off?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:40:23,374",
      "end": "00:40:24,209",
      "text": "Mommy pig?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:40:24,242",
      "end": "00:40:26,077",
      "text": "Absolutely, sir."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:40:26,110",
      "end": "00:40:29,046",
      "text": "Believe me, there's nothing Rosita can't do."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:40:29,080",
      "end": "00:40:31,149",
      "text": "- I can't do this. - Why didn't you tell me"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:40:31,182",
      "end": "00:40:32,617",
      "text": "- you were afraid of heights? - I wasn't."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:40:32,650",
      "end": "00:40:34,619",
      "text": "I-I mean, I've never been afraid in my whole life before,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:40:34,652",
      "end": "00:40:36,788",
      "text": "but I... suddenly, I just..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:40:36,821",
      "end": "00:40:39,090",
      "text": "I don't know what happened to me."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:40:39,123",
      "end": "00:40:41,493",
      "text": "- Did my kids see that? - Hey, you guys."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:40:41,526",
      "end": "00:40:43,261",
      "text": "What's going on up here?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:40:43,294",
      "end": "00:40:44,562",
      "text": "Who is that?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:40:44,596",
      "end": "00:40:46,097",
      "text": "Ooh. Can I try?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:40:46,130",
      "end": "00:40:47,232",
      "text": "No, no, no, no, no, no."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:40:47,265",
      "end": "00:40:49,067",
      "text": "I-I can't let you jump off here."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:40:49,100",
      "end": "00:40:51,769",
      "text": "Daddy, he won't let me jump!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:40:51,803",
      "end": "00:40:54,072",
      "text": "Moon, come on. Let her do the thing."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:40:54,105",
      "end": "00:40:55,807",
      "text": "- Yay! - Porsha, wait!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:40:55,840",
      "end": "00:40:58,576",
      "text": "Whoa, hey. Uh, just a minute."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:41:02,547",
      "end": "00:41:04,749",
      "text": "I love it!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:41:04,782",
      "end": "00:41:06,784",
      "text": "Whee! It's easy!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:41:06,818",
      "end": "00:41:08,686",
      "text": "All right, let's get you down, Rosita."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:41:08,720",
      "end": "00:41:10,321",
      "text": "Oh, my gosh, you guys."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:41:10,355",
      "end": "00:41:13,324",
      "text": "This is exactly like the dream I had last night."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:41:13,358",
      "end": "00:41:16,160",
      "text": "Seriously, you-you were all there."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:41:16,194",
      "end": "00:41:19,130",
      "text": "And you and you and that funny-looking guy over there."
    }
  ],
  "mimicking": [
